==English==

===Pronunciation===
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-æps|-æps]]

===Intransitive verb===
{{rfc-trverb|Intransitive verb}}
To elapse ([[elapses]], [[elapsing]], [[elapsed]])

# (Of time) To pass or move by.
#: ''He allowed a month to elapse before beginning the work.''
#: ''Several days elapsed before they met again.''

